{"track":"r","category":"함수형 도구","level":2,"title":"sapply로 제곱 만들기","desc":"<p>숫자 벡터에서 각 원소의 제곱을 돌려주는 <code>squares(x)</code>를 <code>sapply</code>를 사용해서 만드세요.</p>","starter":"squares <- function(x) {\n  \n}\n","solution":"squares <- function(x) {\n  sapply(x, function(v) v^2)\n}\n","hint":"<p><code>sapply(벡터, function(v) ...)</code> 는 원소마다 함수를 적용해 벡터로 돌려줘요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"squares(c(1, 2, 3))","expected":[1,4,9],"visible":true},{"call":"squares(c(-2, 0))","expected":[4,0],"visible":true},{"call":"squares(5)","expected":25,"visible":false},{"call":"squares(c(0.5, 4))","expected":[0.25,16],"visible":false}],"id":"r-520"}